 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Fixed
+- Multipart media uploads now honor explicit tenant context for unbound administrators while rejecting bound-user tenant switches, malformed tenant paths and worker tenant impersonation. Tenant-scoped dedup preserves existing legacy media ownership.
